Wei -- Daniel's right.

First, the compiler warning is just a warning.
Clang's confused about anonymous namespaces.

I'm getting the same parsing problem myself.  I'll
fix it this afternoon.  I'm in the middle of debugging
the type checking and still need to do for loops.

You do have old versions of the compiler, and the
C++ world seems to change pretty radically from
version to version, so updating might help with
other issues.

- Bob

