From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Thu Dec  8 23:08:53 2011
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 08 Dec 2011 23:08:53 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Poisson bounds checking
Message-ID: <NMX9l4jNtpk.Lhw9INoDDGcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
